<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Trust to forgive loans to mortgage firm.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Trust to forgive loans to mortgage firm.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Trust &amp; Banking Corp said on Monday that it had forgiven 168.67 billion yen worth of loans that it had extended to a housing loan company.  </p>
<p>The loans were those extended to Juso Inc, Mitsubishi Trust said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said forgiving the loans would not affect its earnings forecast for the year to next March 31.</p>
</text>
